Functional requirements

Task submission
- create a task based on input - 3 options available
- create a session of at max 10 task
- one user can submit another session while one in progress
- if a session fails all pending tasks fail, all the finished tasks remain as is
- multiple sessions can run in parallel optimising resource use
- in a single session execute in the order of task submission


- user can fetch the current status of a session
- user cannot cancel an already started session







